WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.795 --> 00:00:04.796
That's right!

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:08.383
I'm going to marry Hinode...

00:00:08.842 --> 00:00:10.802
and move out of here as soon as I can!

00:00:10.969 --> 00:00:12.429
In order to do so...

00:00:14.889 --> 00:00:16.891
I can't let this chance slip away.

00:00:18.309 --> 00:00:20.478
I love him,
and not just because he took me in.

00:00:21.062 --> 00:00:24.065
He named me, a female cat, "Taro."

00:00:24.566 --> 00:00:29.904
That was the name of his previous dog.
He's so loyal.

00:00:31.156 --> 00:00:34.868
He's smart,
but he doesn't take it for granted.

00:00:36.161 --> 00:00:37.370
Taro!

00:00:37.996 --> 00:00:40.206
I know what he's really like.

00:00:40.415 --> 00:00:43.251
He ignores me when I'm Muge,
and that makes me sad.

00:00:45.211 --> 00:00:48.715
But when I'm Taro, he's so sweet to me.

00:00:54.012 --> 00:00:55.847
I love you, Taro.

00:00:58.099 --> 00:01:00.351
You always smell like the sun.

00:01:00.935 --> 00:01:01.895
Hinode!

00:01:02.353 --> 00:01:04.647
I... I'm actually...

00:01:06.483 --> 00:01:07.358
What is it?

00:01:09.903 --> 00:01:11.029
I can't do it.

00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:14.657
I don't have the courage
to tell him I'm Muge.

00:01:20.872 --> 00:01:22.415
You're so lucky, Taro.

00:01:23.208 --> 00:01:26.211
What's wrong, Hinode?

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:29.130
How can I help you?

00:01:30.048 --> 00:01:31.758
I have to make my lunch for tomorrow.

00:01:32.759 --> 00:01:34.552
He's making his own lunch box?

00:01:35.929 --> 00:01:37.055
I want to eat it...

